puls (0.9.1) buster; urgency=medium

  * Added language auto-detection from LANG/LC_ALL environment variables
  * Added interactive process filtering (press / to search, Esc to clear)
  * Added service log viewer shortcut (press g on Services tab for last 50 journald lines)
  * Added dashboard diagnostics panel for system anomaly highlighting
  * Added GPU utilization and temperature to dashboard overview header
  * Added L1/L2/L3 cache sizes to CPU tab parsed from sysfs
  * Added transactional GRUB editor: changes staged in memory, u key opens review modal before any write
  * Replaced users, chrono, clap, and parking_lot with stdlib and custom Unix FFI
  * Fixed Docker tab Up/Down navigation and first-row auto-selection
  * Fixed digit key presses switching tabs while editing a config field
  * Replaced all Unicode emoji/symbols with TTY-safe ASCII alternatives

